						 <blockquote> <p><strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/slashannemoo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4250866&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541185131" alt="slashannemoo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4250866)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/slashannemoo" >slashannemoo</a></span><br /> <strong>Translator:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/slashannemoo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4250866&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541185131" alt="slashannemoo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4250866)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/slashannemoo" >slashannemoo</a></span><br /> <strong>Date of creation:</strong> 2018-09-18<br /> <strong>Original:</strong> <a href="http://scp-pt-br.wikidot.com/scp-021-pt">SCP-021-PT</a> in the Portuguese branch<br /> <strong>Translation:</strong> <a href="http://scp-int.wikidot.com/scp-021-pt">SCP-021-PT</a> in the Translation Archive,<br /> <strong>Image:</strong> <a href="https://pixabay.com/en/cold-ice-iceberg-mountain-ocean-1842622/">Cold Ice Iceberg</a> by <a href="https://pixabay.com/en/users/Pexels-2286921/">Pexels</a> under CC0</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>Additional Context:</strong><br /> This SCP uses a threat level in addition to the normal classification, which is indicated with a color code. You can find an overview of the color codes <a href="http://scp-int.wikidot.com/niveaux-de-menace-des-objets-scp">here</a>.</p> <p>Color code Orange means:<br /> <em>The object is unpredictable, exhibiting dangerous properties and is difficult to recontain. It is generally the lowest level assigned to humanoid entities. Often assigned to Euclid and Keter class objects.</em></p> 
